Omission
- [N1] Node-level omission: i9:after a week (reason: Timing constraint for sending the Excel list is absent from the model.)
- [N2] Node-level omission: i12:After typing the orders into the database, ensure that it is completed. Once the database is completed, (reason: Database completion verification step is not faithfully implemented; closest candidate mutates its purpose.)
- [N3] Node-level omission: ensure that the memo is achieved in the warehouse. (reason: Warehouse acknowledgment requirement is completely missing from the release-memo path.)
- [N4] Node-level omission: and once it is sent, report the achievement to the finance department. (reason: Post-invoice reporting step to finance is omitted from the model.)
